    <record id="product_product_cdek_sms" model="product.product">
        <field name="name">CDEK: Order Delivery Notification</field>
        <field name="sale_ok" eval="False" />
        <field name="purchase_ok" eval="False" />
        <field name="detailed_type">service</field>
        <field name="cdek_reference">SMS</field>
        <field name="default_code">SMS</field>
        <field name="description" type="html">
            <p
            >CDEK offers each client to arrange the "SMS notification of delivery" service.
The sender receives a message with the date and time of delivery. The cost of the service is 10 rubles.
The sender receives an SMS with information about the date/time of delivery and the recipient's full name. For warehouse delivery mode and when specifying the recipient's mobile phone, CDEK provides all clients with a free service: "SMS notification of cargo arrival at the warehouse" or notifications as PUSH messages in the CDEK mobile app or in messengers. The recipient will receive a message with information about the pickup address and office hours.</p>
        </field>
    </record>

